            <Text14 Ref="37" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,3.1,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>494fceba145841b68734eb6c559d7a5a</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text14</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Hai bên thống nhất ký Thỏa thuận đào tạo với các nội dung sau:</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text14>
            <Text15 Ref="38" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,3.3,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>ff5a9f5c8abb4dddb6442fca4a6fb642</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text15</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Điều 1. NỘI DUNG ĐÀO TẠO</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text15>
            <Text16 Ref="39" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.4,3.7,7.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12</Font>
              <Guid>55f8aa4ee3c0498bb25cba8db57a7bcb</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text16</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>&lt;b&gt;• Đơn vị đào tạo:&lt;/b&gt;  {Table0.Don_Vi}</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text16>
            <Text17 Ref="40" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AutoWidth>True</AutoWidth>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,4.3,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>9419a6c85a534aa187bdb8a462af138a</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text17</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Công ty cử Người lao động tham gia khóa đào tạo nhằm phục vụ công việc và phát triển chuyên môn, nghiệp vụ.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text17>
            <Text18 Ref="41" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,4.5,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>fde611da76584e568903a9998db95c38</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text18</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Điều 2. CHI PHÍ ĐÀO TẠO</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text18>
            <Text25 Ref="42" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,4.7,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>c6347f2975634cefb3b47fb23da40786</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text25</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Công ty căn cứ chế độ chính sách chi trả các chi phí đào tạo thực tế, hợp lý theo quy định.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text25>
            <Text26 Ref="43" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,4.9,2.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>f7c2bf34c76e4792a847aba32a3fddda</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text26</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Tổng chi phí đào tạo dự kiến: 
</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text26>
            <Text27 Ref="44" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>2.3,4.9,5.3,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>895ac6c348504095af87bdba7d50b8ba</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text27</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>{Table0.DK_CP_STR}</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextFormat Ref="45" type="NumberFormat" isKey="true">
                <DecimalDigits>0</DecimalDigits>
                <GroupSeparator>.</GroupSeparator>
                <NegativePattern>1</NegativePattern>
                <UseLocalSetting>False</UseLocalSetting>
              </TextFormat>
              <Type>DataColumn</Type>
            </Text27>
            <Text28 Ref="46" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,5.1,7.4,0.3</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>1dc071085bd94956a845fc8f52378cb8</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text28</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Chi phí đào tạo thực tế được xác định căn cứ vào số tiền Công ty thực tế chi trả và chứng từ/căn cứ hợp lệ sau khi khóa học hoàn thành.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text28>
            <Text29 Ref="47" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,5.4,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>0bab570b82d9405ebbee3a5c038a03ac</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text29</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Điều 3. CAM KẾT CỦA NGƯỜI LAO ĐỘNG</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text29>
            <Text30 Ref="48" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,5.6,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>3d135ba7400d461a96967d9890699c64</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text30</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Người lao động cam kết:</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text30>
            <Text31 Ref="49" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,5.8,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>75e6e3cb9c134e28b0263ae5192173b3</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text31</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>1. Tham gia đầy đủ, nghiêm túc và hoàn thành khóa đào tạo.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text31>
            <Text32 Ref="50" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,6,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>1f8c9b106dda404eb2c23da3cbd6e8a2</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text32</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>2. Tuân thủ quy định của Công ty và đơn vị đào tạo.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text32>
            <Text21 Ref="51" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,6.2,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>ed954ab5df3146cd9de48a899a3534bd</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text21</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>3. Sau khi hoàn thành khóa học, thực hiện đào tạo/chia sẻ lại kiến thức theo phân công của Công ty.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text21>
            <Text22 Ref="52" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,6.4,7.1,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>10a74fc9c762413991521f2839621b43</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text22</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>4. Cam kết tiếp tục làm việc tại Công ty tối thiểu &lt;b&gt;{Table0.TG_LV} tháng/năm&lt;/b&gt; kể từ ngày hoàn thành khóa đào tạo.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text22>
            <Text24 Ref="53" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,6.6,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>8e1a8dd9d56e41e8b6f0daa8e89f00d1</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text24</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Điều 4. HOÀN TRẢ CHI PHÍ ĐÀO TẠO</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text24>
            <Text33 Ref="54" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,6.8,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>36004687b6264129a926e517bae82b63</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text33</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Người lao động có trách nhiệm hoàn trả chi phí đào tạo nếu &lt;b&gt;tự ý bỏ học, không hoàn thành khóa học do lỗi của mình hoặc tự ý nghỉ việc/đơn phương chấm dứt HĐLĐ trái quy định pháp luật trong thời gian cam kết.&lt;/b&gt;</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text33>
            <Text41 Ref="55" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,7,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>a44b0e9ee02345b3bd6b8a5a06ff3ef1</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text41</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Trường hợp đã hoàn thành khóa học nhưng chưa thực hiện đủ thời gian cam kết, số tiền hoàn trả được tính:</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text41>
            <Text42 Ref="56" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,7.2,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>d585100ccd3d45f99ae26356b583260b</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text42</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Số tiền hoàn trả = Chi phí đào tạo thực tế × Thời gian cam kết còn lại / Tổng thời gian cam kết.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text42>
            <Text43 Ref="57" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,7.4,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>98c5abe8f67e4667a64ef92563ee86ab</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text43</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Trường hợp chấm dứt HĐLĐ không do lỗi của Người lao động hoặc pháp luật không quy định nghĩa vụ hoàn trả thì Người lao động không phải hoàn trả chi phí đào tạo.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text43>
            <Text44 Ref="58" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,7.6,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>4e0a7761166f4b8dafd88df15badd56a</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text44</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="9" />
              <Text>Điều 5. ĐIỀU KHOẢN CHUNG</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text44>
            <Text45 Ref="59" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,7.8,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11</Font>
              <Guid>9e89630286fd4a0f8971e5f7d029fa28</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
